This project uses historical border geometries sliced at 1900-06-21 from:
  CShapes 2.0 (ETH Zurich International Conflict Research)
  https://icr.ethz.ch/data/cshapes/
  Schvitz, Guy, Seraina Rüegger, Luc Girardin, Lars-Erik Cederman,
  Nils B. Weidmann, and Kristian Skrede Gleditsch (2022).
  "Mapping The International System, 1886–2019: The CShapes 2.0 Dataset."
  Journal of Conflict Resolution.

